  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "藉著等離子構成的身體\n能夠進到電器裡面的寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "85C984577B4996E25B5069CB621076848EAB9AD4000A80FD59209032523096FB566888E1976276845BF653EF59222026202600100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是洛托姆！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F6D1B625859C6FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也有手機洛托姆對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F6709624B6A5F6D1B625859C65C0D5427300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由於製造數取決於洛托姆的個體數多寡，\n所以手機洛托姆非～常貴重！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "753165BC88FD9020657853D66C7A65BC6D1B625859C67684500B9AD46578591A5BE1FF0C000A62404EE5624B6A5F6D1B625859C6975EFF5E5E388CB491CDFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然手機洛托姆也十分有魅力，\n但洛托姆的真本事在於牠能進到電器裡！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136624B6A5F6D1B625859C64E5F5341520667099B45529BFF0C000A4F466D1B625859C67684771F672C4E8B572865BC726080FD9032523096FB566888E1FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要不要和洛托姆對戰看看呢？\n牠能進到各種電器裡變化形態喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B389814E0D8981548C6D1B625859C65C0D6230770B770B5462FF1F000A726080FD9032523054047A2E96FB566888E18B8A53165F62614B5594300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳想和各種形態的洛托姆對戰，\n就來告訴我一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B360F3548C54047A2E5F62614B76846D1B625859C65C0D6230FF0C000A5C314F86544A8A3462114E0080725427300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "猜猜洛托姆會進入\n什麼樣的電器呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "731C731C6D1B625859C6670390325165000A4EC09EBC6A23768496FB56685462FF1F00100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是來和各種形態的\n洛托姆對戰的，對吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F300100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F4F86548C54047A2E5F62614B7684000A6D1B625859C65C0D62307684FF0C5C0D5427FF1F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我還沒要對戰",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621190846C9289815C0D62300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別賣關子了，\n來和洛托姆對戰嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52258CE395DC5B504E86FF0C000A4F86548C6D1B625859C65C0D6230561B300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "洛托姆的厲害！魅力！\n就在於牠和電器的搭配組合！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n首先登場的是這隻洛托姆！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D1B625859C6768453B25BB3FF019B45529BFF01000A5C31572865BC7260548C96FB56687684642D914D7D445408FF0100100001BE00000A99965148767B58347684662F901996BB6D1B625859C6FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "猜猜洛托姆會進入\n什麼樣的電器呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "731C731C6D1B625859C6670390325165000A4EC09EBC6A23768496FB56685462FF1F00100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
