      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠能學會「飛葉風暴」這個招式！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "726080FD5B786703300C98DB844998A866B4300D9019500B62DB5F0FFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "問題在於<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有沒有一片\n非得讓牠幫忙割草的大院子。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
