      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "旋轉洛托姆的屬性是\n電還有飛行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65CB8F496D1B625859C676845C6C6027662F000A96FB9084670998DB884CFF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠能學會「空氣斬」這個招式！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "726080FD5B786703300C7A7A6C2365AC300D9019500B62DB5F0FFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然，就像指示牠出招式那樣，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳可以聲控電風扇喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF0C5C3150CF6307793A726051FA62DB5F0F90A36A23FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B353EF4EE5807263A796FB98A862475594FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但牠還有點俏皮，\n有時會把重要的文件吹得滿天飛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F467260908467099EDE4FCF76AEFF0C000A670966426703628A91CD8981768465874EF654395F976EFF592998DBFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "旋轉洛托姆的風力！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳覺得如何呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65CB8F496D1B625859C6768498A8529BFF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B389BA5F9759824F555462FF1F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最後一隻！進到了冰箱的洛托姆，\n會被稱為結冰洛托姆！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67005F8C4E0096BBFF01903252304E8651B07BB176846D1B625859C6FF0C000A670388AB7A3170BA7D5051B06D1B625859C6FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "酷得我都要結凍了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91775F97621190FD89817D5051CD4E86FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "結冰洛托姆的屬性是\n電還有冰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D5051B06D1B625859C676845C6C6027662F000A96FB9084670951B0FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠能學會「暴風雪」這個招式！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "726080FD5B786703300C66B498A896EA300D9019500B62DB5F0FFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是隻會用冷氣讓周圍都結冰的頭痛傢伙！\n這樣的話，大概不會有人想要吧……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F96BB6703752851B76C238B935468570D90FD7D5051B07684982D75DB50A24F19FF01000A90196A2376848A71FF0C592769824E0D670367094EBA60F3898154272026202600100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "順便告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，洛托姆的形態變化\n是和特殊的馬達有關係喔～<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98064FBF544A8A3400100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C6D1B625859C676845F62614B8B8A5316000A662F548C72796B8A768499AC9054670995DC4FC25594FF5E00100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說著說著洛托姆的魅力，\n不知不覺中對戰就結束了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA84578AAA84576D1B625859C676849B45529BFF0C000A4E0D77E54E0D89BA4E2D5C0D62305C317D50675F4E865462300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "伽勒爾地區還有無人機洛托姆、\n洛托姆自行車等，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n牠可以說是在各方面大展身手。不過……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F3D52D2723E573053409084670971214EBA6A5F6D1B625859C63001000A6D1B625859C681EA884C8ECA7B49FF0C00100001BE00000A726053EF4EE58AAA662F5728540465B9976259275C558EAB624B30024E0D904E2026202600100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "基本上，\n洛托姆是愛搗蛋的嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57FA672C4E0AFF0C000A6D1B625859C6662F611B641786CB7684561BFF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也許作為電器會很難妥善運用。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8A314F5C70BA96FB566867035F8896E359A55584904B7528300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但有<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的實力，也許能在對戰中\n靈活運用各種形態的洛托姆！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46670900100003110000FF01014F6059B376845BE6529BFF0C4E5F8A3180FD57285C0D62304E2D000A97486D3B904B752854047A2E5F62614B76846D1B625859C6FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此呢，請讓我贈送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這個\n能夠改變洛托姆形態的型錄！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B645462FF0C8ACB8B9362118D08900100100003110000FF01014F6059B39019500B000A80FD592065398B8A6D1B625859C65F62614B7684578B9304FF0100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在哪裡捉到了野生的洛托姆，\n請使用這個型錄看看。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3572854EA88E1634952304E8691CE751F76846D1B625859C6FF0C000A8ACB4F7F75289019500B578B9304770B770B300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隨著各種機器、電器被開發上市，\n洛托姆的形態大概也會跟進吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96A8845754047A2E6A5F5668300196FB566888AB958B767C4E0A5E02FF0C000A6D1B625859C676845F62614B592769824E5F67038DDF90325427300200100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是說，洛托姆有無限大的可能性！\n這堪稱為洛托姆<U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+000D>Text_infinity啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8AAAFF0C6D1B625859C66709712196505927768453EF80FD6027FF01000A9019582A7A3170BA6D1B625859C600100002BD0A000D0054006500780074005F0069006E00660069006E006900740079554AFF01FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有在用洛托姆的型錄\n讓洛托姆改變形態嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B36709572875286D1B625859C67684578B9304000A8B936D1B625859C665398B8A5F62614B55CEFF1F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說不定哪天洛托姆會進到所有的家電裡面，\n搞出令人大吃一驚的惡作劇呢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA4E0D5B9A54EA59296D1B625859C66703903252306240670976845BB696FB88E19762FF0C000A641E51FA4EE44EBA592754034E009A5A768460E14F5C52875462FF0100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "科吱吱～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "79D154315431FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    }
  ],
